      "locked": false,
      "id": "d1-sum-d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 68,
      "text": "\ud83c\udf99 ai-coustics  cleans every microphone clip first \u2014 the only way Whisper makes sense at 130 BPM techno.\n\ud83e\udd16 Gemini  drives the agent's brain (intent \u2192 Strudel code) and the recovery layer (auto-fix on runtime error). It only ever sees clean text from ai-coustics + Whisper.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Pioneer GLiNER2  acts on Gemini's output (the live code), classifying it into a viz tag.   \ud83d\udcde telli  is the framing the whole loop is shaped by \u2014 listen, decide, act, recover.",
      "originalText": "\ud83c\udf99 ai-coustics  cleans every microphone clip first \u2014 the only way Whisper makes sense at 130 BPM techno.\n\ud83e\udd16 Gemini  drives the agent's brain (intent \u2192 Strudel code) and the recovery layer (auto-fix on runtime error). It only ever sees clean text from ai-coustics + Whisper.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Pioneer GLiNER2  acts on Gemini's output (the live code), classifying it into a viz tag.   \ud83d\udcde telli  is the framing the whole loop is shaped by \u2014 listen, decide, act, recover.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
