      "id": "d2-leg-d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 1878,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 88,
      "text": "\u2460  POST /transcribe       \u2500\u2500 ai-coustics enhance  +  Whisper \u00d7 2  +  Gemini cleanup    \u2192  clean transcript\n\u2461  POST /generate         \u2500\u2500 chat-session  +  skill assembly  +  Gemini code-gen  +  validate    \u2192  Strudel code\n\u2462  POST /recommend-viz   \u2500\u2500 Pioneer GLiNER2 entity classifier on the new code        \u2192  viz tag (background)\n\u2463  POST /generate/fix     \u2500\u2500 stateless one-shot Gemini repair  (only if hot-swapped pattern throws within 1.5 s)",
      "originalText": "\u2460  POST /transcribe       \u2500\u2500 ai-coustics enhance  +  Whisper \u00d7 2  +  Gemini cleanup    \u2192  clean transcript\n\u2461  POST /generate         \u2500\u2500 chat-session  +  skill assembly  +  Gemini code-gen  +  validate    \u2192  Strudel code\n\u2462  POST /recommend-viz   \u2500\u2500 Pioneer GLiNER2 entity classifier on the new code        \u2192  viz tag (background)\n\u2463  POST /generate/fix     \u2500\u2500 stateless one-shot Gemini repair  (only if hot-swapped pattern throws within 1.5 s)",
